    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS offer to the market this two bedroom, two bathroom corner apartment located in the gated development of Aras na Cluaine, Clondalkin. This popular development in located within easy access to a whole host of amenities including schools, shops, recreational facilities and is within walking distance to Clondalkin Village. Transport wise you have good access to local bus routes, Red Cow Luas and N7/M50 road networks.\n\nInternal living accommodation of c.65 Sqm can be found here and in brief consists of; Entrance hall, storage cupboard, two double bedrooms with master ensuite and a family bathroom. The property then leads to an open plan lounge/dining/kitchen area with front facing balcony of SOUTH WEST origentation and dual aspect flooding the property with natural light.  Externally this development offers underground secure parking and communal gardens. Due to recent success in the development we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest!\n\nAdditional features include no onward chain, new kitchen and flooring, underground parking, gated development and lift and stairs access.\n\nKey Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>2 BED/ 2 BATH</li>\n <li>2nd floor CORNER apartment</li>\n <li>Ready for immediate occupancy with no onward chain!</li>\n <li>Recently NEW fitted kitchen & floors</li>\n <li>SOUTH WEST facing Balcony</li>\n <li>Dual aspect lounge flooded with natural light</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>c. 65 Sqm</li>\n <li>Lift and stairs access</li>\n <li>Management fees c. 1600 per annum</li>\n <li>Superb location</li>\n <li>Balcony to front</li>\n <li>Double bedroom with ensuite</li>\n <li>Secure residential parking</li>\n <li>Gated development</li>\n <li>Close to shops, schools and major road networks</li>\n <li>Viewing is highly advised!</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\n \nEircode = D22 HY30.\n\nAs you go into the Aras na Cluaine development, turn left and go over the bridge. Block A will be in front of you, go to level 2 via stairs or lift and take a right turn, then a left turn. No. 20 will be down the corridor to your left."
      },
      {
